      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] ✅ **LGTM** — All checks pass. [[trajectory](go/traj/14630597-f5e4-42a0-9bb1-56569ad5e90a)]\n\n### Review Summary\n* **Functionality**: The CL accurately and comprehensively replaces legacy `SECTION_IS_RO` and `SECTION_IS_RW` macros with `CONFIG_CROS_EC_RO` and `CONFIG_CROS_EC_RW` across the codebase. It properly relies on Zephyr\u0027s Kconfig system and cleans up the Makefiles and `zmake` scripts.\n* **Security**: No security concerns. The patch is strictly a structural refactoring of build macros.\n* **Style \u0026 Consistency**: The updates are consistently applied across C source files, header files, test configurations (`testcase.yaml`, `prj.conf`), and build files.\n* **Testing \u0026 Test Coverage**: Test environments have been appropriately updated to define the new variables using `extra_configs` rather than `extra_args` with `EXTRA_CFLAGS`.\n* **CL Size \u0026 Scope**: This is an atomic, self-contained refactoring CL. The large number of modified files is justified given the mechanical nature of replacing these macros globally.\n\nTAG\u003dagy\nCONV\u003d71aef82a-6b7f-458e-b476-7f2b354c0be3",
